* Wed Apr 12 2023 Michael Stauber <mstauber@solarspeed.net> 4.0-13
- Modified ci4/app/Controllers/BaseController.php as function
  getSSH() was returning NULL on expired sessions. This was supposed
  to force users back to the login screen, but resulted in an error
  instead because most GUI pages eventually call
  $CI->serverScriptHelper->getHtmlComponentFactory() before
  $CI->getAllowed(), which then results in calling a function of
  a NULL object. To sort this out we now force instanciation of
  $this->serverScriptHelper if it's not already present. This
  allows the code to circle all the way to the point where finally
  $CI->getAllowed() can trigger safely to bump the visitor with
  expired session back to the login screen.

